{"id":"df67b9abe6db5f2c","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md","title":"Algebraic Tensor Space Data","display":"df-algebraic-tensor-space-data — Algebraic Tensor Space Data","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data","aliases":["58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data"],"display":"df-algebraic-tensor-space-data — Algebraic Tensor Space Data","depends_on":["[[58-df-tensor.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-algebraic-tensor-space-data — Algebraic Tensor Space Data"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9bf75150bce95ccc\" href=\"?note=9bf75150bce95ccc\" title=\"58-df-tensor.md\">58-df-tensor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K=\\langle k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal K=\\langle k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 上指定运算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_A,\\odot_A,+_B,\\odot_B\">\\(+_A,\\odot_A,+_B,\\odot_B\\)</span>。所有变量为集合，二元运算使用有序对。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}\\)</span> 使用所引文件的精确接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_A,0_B\">\\(0_A,0_B\\)</span> 是所给加法的唯一零元。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{A,B}=\\langle\\mathcal K,\\langle A,+_A,0_A,\\rho_A\\rangle,\\langle B,+_B,0_B,\\odot_B\\rangle\\rangle\">\\(D_{A,B}=\\langle\\mathcal K,\\langle A,+_A,0_A,\\rho_A\\rangle,\\langle B,+_B,0_B,\\odot_B\\rangle\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_A=\\{\\langle\\langle x,a\\rangle,\\odot_A(a,x)\\rangle:x\\in A,a\\in k\\}\">\\(\\rho_A=\\{\\langle\\langle x,a\\rangle,\\odot_A(a,x)\\rangle:x\\in A,a\\in k\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_{Q,58}\">\\(+_{Q,58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_{58}\">\\(\\iota_{58}\\)</span> 在下式中取参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Q,F,N,A,B,k,D_{A,B})\">\\((Q,F,N,A,B,k,D_{A,B})\\)</span> 所确定的函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TensorSpace}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{TensorSpace}_{58}\\)</span> 显式记录张量空间的线性结构。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对有限记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle\">\\(\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_i\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle=a_i\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_i\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle=a_i\\)</span>。带结构记录的显式谓词中，运算及零元记号均缩写当前记录的对应分量；记录格式不满足时该谓词为假。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearData}\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearData}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(f,A,B,k,+_A,\\odot_A,+_B,\\odot_B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nf\\in B^A\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\forall a\\in k\\;\n\\bigl(f(x+_Ay)=f(x)+_Bf(y)\\land f(\\odot_A(a,x))=\\odot_B(a,f(x))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(f,A,B,k,+_A,\\odot_A,+_B,\\odot_B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nf\\in B^A\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\forall a\\in k\\;\n\\bigl(f(x+_Ay)=f(x)+_Bf(y)\\land f(\\odot_A(a,x))=\\odot_B(a,f(x))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TensorSpace}_{58}(Q,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\iota;A,+_A,\\odot_A,B,+_B,\\odot_B,\\mathcal K)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal K=\\langle k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(A,k,+_A,\\odot_A,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(B,k,+_B,\\odot_B,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists F,N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}(Q,F,N,A,B,k,D_{A,B})\n\\land+_Q=+_{Q,58}\\land\\iota=\\iota_{58}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(Q,k,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\forall a\\in k\\;\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall y\\in B\\;\n\\odot_Q(a,\\iota(x,y))=\\iota(\\odot_A(a,x),y).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TensorSpace}_{58}(Q,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\iota;A,+_A,\\odot_A,B,+_B,\\odot_B,\\mathcal K)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal K=\\langle k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(A,k,+_A,\\odot_A,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(B,k,+_B,\\odot_B,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists F,N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}(Q,F,N,A,B,k,D_{A,B})\n\\land+_Q=+_{Q,58}\\land\\iota=\\iota_{58}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(Q,k,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\forall a\\in k\\;\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall y\\in B\\;\n\\odot_Q(a,\\iota(x,y))=\\iota(\\odot_A(a,x),y).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补齐余代数和双代数实际调用的规范代数张量空间；不是 Hilbert 完备张量积。线性映射测试不重选载集上的运算。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-tensor.md","status":"resolved","id":"9bf75150bce95ccc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tensor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Field}$ 取 [[../batch13/58-df-field.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal K=\\langle k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"+_A,\\odot_A,+_B,\\odot_B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"0_A,0_B","display":false},{"tex":"D_{A,B}=\\langle\\mathcal K,\\langle A,+_A,0_A,\\rho_A\\rangle,\\langle B,+_B,0_B,\\odot_B\\rangle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_A=\\{\\langle\\langle x,a\\rangle,\\odot_A(a,x)\\rangle:x\\in A,a\\in k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"+_{Q,58}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"(Q,F,N,A,B,k,D_{A,B})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TensorSpace}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pr}_i\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle=a_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(f,A,B,k,+_A,\\odot_A,+_B,\\odot_B)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nf\\in B^A\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\forall a\\in k\\;\n\\bigl(f(x+_Ay)=f(x)+_Bf(y)\\land f(\\odot_A(a,x))=\\odot_B(a,f(x))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TensorSpace}_{58}(Q,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\iota;A,+_A,\\odot_A,B,+_B,\\odot_B,\\mathcal K)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathcal K=\\langle k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(A,k,+_A,\\odot_A,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(B,k,+_B,\\odot_B,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists F,N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}(Q,F,N,A,B,k,D_{A,B})\n\\land+_Q=+_{Q,58}\\land\\iota=\\iota_{58}\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(Q,k,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\forall a\\in k\\;\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall y\\in B\\;\n\\odot_Q(a,\\iota(x,y))=\\iota(\\odot_A(a,x),y).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2709,"backlinks":[{"id":"004e048b3416923c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{LinearData}$ 取 [[../batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"df38af7e4180f1bc","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{LinearData}$ 取 [[../batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md|58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["9bf75150bce95ccc","1eb4a89b005d9cda","592f9cfb66a507c2"]}